      "name": "dsh-doraemon",
      "title": {
        "en": "Doraemon",
        "zh": "Doraemon 桌面自动化"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Drive Windows apps and the browser from DSH: window binding, UIA trees, local OCR and YOLO element parsing, clicks, typing, clipboard and file drops. The bridge runs as a Python kernel owned by the plugin, with its model weights bundled, so no GPU service or external bridge is needed.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 里操作 Windows 应用与浏览器：窗口绑定、UIA 元素树、本地 OCR/YOLO 元素解析、点击、输入、剪贴板与文件拖放。桥接内核是插件自带的 Python 进程，模型权重随包分发，不需要 GPU 服务或外部桥接程序。"
      },
      "icon": "./icon.png",
